<% if(it.question){ %>Request: <%= it.question %><% } else { %>Use the person's latest request in the inherited conversation.<% } %>
Mode constraint: <%= it.mode %>
Available abilities: <%= JSON.stringify(it.abilities) %>
Available attachment digests: <%= JSON.stringify(it.inputs) %>
<% if(it.context){ %>Current boundary and evidence: <%= it.context %><% } %>
